pub relation l18_advance_credit_scope(d: Disclosure) kind empirical {
    label en unofficial "case fact: the disclosure is of return information with respect to a certified individual (section 7527(c)) to a provider of health insurance for that individual, only to the extent necessary to carry out the program established by section 7527 (advance payment of credit for health insurance costs of eligible individuals) — section 6103(l)(18)";
